      - "Only GPT-5.6 Terra was explicitly marked default. Single-value options encode operator-fixed effort, not upstream effort defaults. Custom strings remain available."
      - "Picker context figures (400K, 264K, 266K, 328K, 328K, unknown) are informational and retained in the evidence, not selectable context settings or inferred token limits."
    models:
